  <p class=MsoNormal>Al-ajal ya imaam..(4)</p> 
  <p class=MsoNormal>Al-ajal, al-ajal ya imam-e-zamaan</p> 
  <p class=MsoNormal>Al-ajal, al-ajal ya imam-e-zamaan al-ajal..(2)</p> 
  <p class=MsoNormal>As-salam-o-alaika ya sahib-az-zamaa..</p> 
  <p class=MsoNormal>&nbsp;</p> 
  <p class=MsoNormal>Tera hai intezaar aaja, ya imaam</p> 
  <p class=MsoNormal>Zehra ke pursadaar aaja, ya imaam</p> 
  <p class=MsoNormal>Waris-e-zulfiqaar aaja, ya imaam</p> 
  <p class=MsoNormal>Al-ajal ya imam</p> 
  <p class=MsoNormal>Aajaiye bus aap ka hi intezaar hai, intezaar hai</p> 
  <p class=MsoNormal>Is daur ka ilaaj faqad zulfiqaar hai, zulfiqaar hai</p> 
  <p class=MsoNormal>Behre inteqam-e-pehlu-e-zehra..(2)</p> 
  <p class=MsoNormal>Behre inteqam-e-khoon-e-husain</p> 
  <p class=MsoNormal>Aye gul-e-narjis biya biya..(2)</p> 
  <p class=MsoNormal>&nbsp;</p> 
  <p class=MsoNormal>Aisa ho ek ashura, kaabe me majlis ho barpa</p> 
  <p class=MsoNormal>Tu mimbar pe jalwa numa, tu padhe majlis hum nauha</p> 
  <p class=MsoNormal>Tere bina ho kese khwaab ye pura</p> 
  <p class=MsoNormal>Kabe se nikle juloos-e-ashura</p> 
  <p class=MsoNormal>Ae ibn-e-sarallah, jaan-e shere khuda, waris-ul-aimmah, ae hujjat-e-khuda</p> 
  <p class=MsoNormal>Behre inteqam-e-pehlu-e-zehra..(2)</p> 
  <p class=MsoNormal>Behre inteqam-e-khoon-e-husain, hussain hussain hussain</p> 
  <p class=MsoNormal>Aye gul-e-narjis biya biya..(4)</p> 
  <p class=MsoNormal>&nbsp;</p> 
  <p class=MsoNormal>Tu hai farzand-e-zehra todke sadiyo ka pehra</p> 
  <p class=MsoNormal>Tu hi jiska waris hai kabe tu wo alam lehra</p> 
  <p class=MsoNormal>Hum hi nahi hai azadaar hai tub hi</p> 
  <p class=MsoNormal>Tera alam hai alamdaar hai tub hi</p> 
  <p class=MsoNormal>Ae ibn-e-sarallah, jaan-e shere khuda, waris-ul-aimmah, ae hujjat-e-khuda</p> 
  <p class=MsoNormal>Behre inteqam-e-pehlu-e-zehra..(2)</p> 
  <p class=MsoNormal>Behre inteqam-e-khoon-e-hussain, hussain hussain hussain</p> 
  <p class=MsoNormal>Aye gul-e-narjis biya biya..(6)</p> 
  <p class=MsoNormal>&nbsp;</p> 
  <p class=MsoNormal>Saath tere ye ehl-e-aza jaaye shaam aur karbobala</p> 
  <p class=MsoNormal>Qabr-e-shahedeen par jaakar de tujhe tere jadd kar pursa</p> 
  <p class=MsoNormal>Aisa banaye waha matami halqa</p> 
  <p class=MsoNormal>Jis me ali bhi ho, hasan bhi aur Mustafa</p> 
  <p class=MsoNormal>Ae ibn-e-sarallah, jaan-e shere khuda, waris-ul-aimmah, ae hujjat-e-khuda</p> 
  <p class=MsoNormal>Behre inteqam-e-pehlu-e-zehra..(2)</p> 
  <p class=MsoNormal>Behre inteqam-e-khoon-e-hussain, hussain hussain hussain</p> 
  <p class=MsoNormal>Aye gul-e-narjis biya biya..(6)</p> 
  <p class=MsoNormal>&nbsp;</p> 
  <p class=MsoNormal>Qaatilan-e-sheh ko mita de, saara jahaa milkar ye sadaa de</p> 
  <p class=MsoNormal>Sayyad-us-shohada, hussain hussain</p> 
  <p class=MsoNormal>Mazloom-e-karbala, hussain hussain</p> 
  <p class=MsoNormal>Waris-ul-ambiya, hussain hussain</p> 
  <p class=MsoNormal>Ae ibn-e-sayyada, hussain hussain</p> 
  <p class=MsoNormal><span style=mso-spacerun:yes>&nbsp;</span>Saare zamane me yahi gunje ek naara, hussain hussain</p> 
  <p class=MsoNormal>Aye gul-e-narjis biya biya..(6)</p> 
  <p class=MsoNormal>&nbsp;</p> 
  <p class=MsoNormal>Aap hi qaaed ho hamare, farsh-e-aza pe har dil ye pukare</p> 
  <p class=MsoNormal>Sayyad-us-shohada, hussain hussain</p> 
  <p class=MsoNormal>Mazloom-e-karbala, hussain hussain</p> 
  <p class=MsoNormal>Waris-ul-ambiya, hussain hussain</p> 
  <p class=MsoNormal>Ae ibn-e-sayyada, hussain hussain</p> 
  <p class=MsoNormal>Masjid me bhi, mandir me bhi , gunje ek naara, hussain hussain</p> 
  <p class=MsoNormal>Aye gul-e-narjis biya biya..(6)</p> 
  <p class=MsoNormal>&nbsp;</p> 
  <p class=MsoNormal>Ye jahaa bhool na jae kahi karbobala, al madad ya imam-e-zamaa</p> 
  <p class=MsoNormal>Ja bajaa dekhe nigaahe yuhi farsh-e-aza, al-madad ya imam-e-zamaa</p> 
  <p class=MsoNormal>Kaun hai waris-e- farsh-e-aza maula</p> 
  <p class=MsoNormal>Kise bulae tere siwaa..(2)</p> 
  <p class=MsoNormal>Aye gul-e-narjis biya biya..(6)</p> 
  <p class=MsoNormal>&nbsp;</p> 
  <p class=MsoNormal>Marqad-e-khair-un-nisa pet u roza bana, al madad ya imam-e-zamaa</p> 
  <p class=MsoNormal>Zulm ki zadd pe hai roza bibi zainab ka, al madad ya imam-e-zamaa</p> 
  <p class=MsoNormal>Jab likha tujhko ariza yahi baat likhi</p> 
  <p class=MsoNormal>Kise bulae tere siwaa..(2)</p> 
  <p class=MsoNormal>Aye gul-e-narjis biya biya..(2)</p> 
  <p class=MsoNormal>&nbsp;</p> 
  <p class=MsoNormal>Haay..</p> 
  <p class=MsoNormal>Manzar ye padhke aaj bhi hote hai dil figaar</p> 
  <p class=MsoNormal>Baithe hue hai aap musalle pe ashkbaar</p> 
  <p class=MsoNormal>Deodi pe zuljanaah ho alam bhi hai sogwaar</p> 
  <p class=MsoNormal>Pehlu me zulfiqaar hai chalne ko beqaraar, chalne ko beqaraar</p> 
  <p class=MsoNormal><span style=mso-spacerun:yes>&nbsp;</span>Wirde zabaa hai ziyarat-e-naahiya baar baar</p> 
  <p class=MsoNormal>&nbsp;</p> 
  <p class=MsoNormal>Haay..</p> 
  <p class=MsoNormal>Ho salaam unpe ke jin laasho ko paamaal kiya</p> 
  <p class=MsoNormal>Ho salaam uspe dame qatl jo pyaasa hi raha</p> 
  <p class=MsoNormal>Ho salaam uspe ke paikar se chhida jiska gala</p> 
  <p class=MsoNormal>Ho salaam uspe jo tukdo me bata wa waila</p> 
  <p class=MsoNormal>Jiska laasha mehroom-e-kafan uspe salaam</p> 
  <p class=MsoNormal>Jiska loota gaya ek din me chaman uspe salaam</p> 
  <p class=MsoNormal>Hussain maula hussain maula..(3)</p> 
  <p class=MsoNormal>&nbsp;</p> 
  <p class=MsoNormal>Haay..</p> 
  <p class=MsoNormal>Jiske seene me hai barchi ki ani usko salaam</p> 
  <p class=MsoNormal>Jo tha hamshakl-e-rasool-e-madani usko salaam</p> 
  <p class=MsoNormal>Aag jis bibi ke daaman me lagi usko salaam</p> 
  <p class=MsoNormal>Nauke naiza se rida jiski chini usko salaam</p> 
  <p class=MsoNormal>Jinke baazu hue paband-e-rasan unpe salaam</p> 
  <p class=MsoNormal>Jinke zakhmi hue durro se badan unpe salaam</p> 
  <p class=MsoNormal>Hussain maula hussain maula..(3)</p> 
  <p class=MsoNormal>&nbsp;</p> 
  <p class=MsoNormal>Sad alwida hussaina, hussain hussain hussaina</p> 
  <p class=MsoNormal>Ya hasrata hussaina, hussain hussain hussaina</p> 
  <p class=MsoNormal>Wa ghurbata hussaina, hussain hussain hussaina</p> 
  <p class=MsoNormal>Ae bekhata hussaina, hussain hussain hussaina</p> 
  <p class=MsoNormal>Bus taziyana harjaa, , hussain hussain hussaina</p> 
  <p class=MsoNormal>&nbsp;</p> 
  <p class=MsoNormal>Haay Pehlu-e-bint-e-zehra, hussain hussain hussaina</p> 
  <p class=MsoNormal>Hussain maula hussain maula hussain</p> 
  <p class=MsoNormal>Bekas, Ghareeb, Shaheed, pyasa.</p> 
  <p class=MsoNormal>Hussain hussain hussain..</p>
